<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Aug c/a surplus 4.6 bln crowns.</title>
<headline>Swedish Aug c/a surplus 4.6 bln crowns.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's current account for August showed a surplus of 4.6 billion crowns for a surplus of 51.2 billion in the previous 12 months, central bank (Riksbank) figures showed on Friday.  </p>
<p>    SWEDISH CURRENT ACCOUNT	 AUG 96    JULY 96     AUG 95</p>
<p>    Monthly balance		   +4.6	  +3.1	  -1.1</p>
<p>    Year/year			  +51.2	 +45.5	 +23.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in billions of crowns. Average market expectations from a poll of 13 analysts had been for a surplus of 3.0 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
